  "bio": {
    "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
    "text": "Bandi Sanjay Kumar is an Indian politician who is appointed Minister of State for Home Affairs. He is a Member of the Lok Sabha, the lower house of the Parliament of India, representing the Karimnagar constituency since 2019. He is the former state president of the Bharatiya Janata Party in Telangana from 11 March 2020 to 4 July 2023. He is All India Institute of Medical Sciences, Bibinagar board member. He was named as National General Secretary on 29 July 2023 by the BJP National President.",
